    "location": "The Oslo, at Sandyford Central, forms part of a brand-new development of over 550 apartments located immediately beside Stillorgan Luas stop. The Oslo benefits from all of the convenience of its superb location; close to the retail and leisure amenities of Stillorgan, Dundrum, Blackrock, Mount Merrion and Dun Laoghaire while being in the middle of Sandyford Business District. \r\n\r\nIf retail therapy is your style, Dundrum Town Centre is only down the road from The Oslo. This is Irelandâ€™s largest shopping centre, and offers over 150 retail stores, restaurants, cafÃ©s and leisure facilities, including a theatre and cinema complex. Thereâ€™s also a fine selection of eateries within walking distance of The Oslo â€“ from Michelin-level dining to takeout options of all kinds. Budding chefs can also source excellent local ingredients at the gourmet food stores in the neighbourhood, and then show off their skills to friends and family in The Osloâ€™s chef kitchen lounge.\r\n\r\nEnjoy all that the locality has to offer, you're just minutes away from hiking in the Dublin Mountains, biking in Ticknock, sea swimming in Monkstown, or leisurely strolls on Killiney Beach, or stay at home and enjoy your best-in-class amenities and outdoor public realm."
